---
// HowItWorks copy is inline — only used once on the homepage
---

<section class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="text-center mb-16">
    <div
      class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 text-primary text-lg font-semibold"
    >
      How It Works
    </div>
    <h2
      class="reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4"
    >
      From brand input to search intelligence
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      PhantomRank runs structured queries across AI assistants and search
      engines to turn brand inputs into actionable search intelligence. Track
      when you’re recommended, when you’re invisible, and how you stack up
      against competitors.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="relative grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
    <!-- Connector line (desktop only) -->
    <div
      class="absolute top-16 left-[16.67%] right-[16.67%] hidden md:block h-px bg-border"
    >
    </div>

    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="reveal text-center">
      <div class="relative mx-auto mb-6">
        <div
          class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border-2 border-primary text-primary text-xl font-bold"
        >
          1
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">
        Input brand, industry, and competitors
      </h3>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-xs mx-auto">
        Enter your brand or client name, industry, and top competitors.
        PhantomRank builds intent-based prompts and keyword sets that reflect
        real buyer journeys.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="reveal text-center">
      <div class="relative mx-auto mb-6">
        <div
          class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border-2 border-primary text-primary text-xl font-bold"
        >
          2
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">
        We query AI assistants and search
      </h3>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-xs mx-auto">
        We run targeted questions across Perplexity and other AI assistants
        (ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude coming soon), alongside traditional search.
        Every citation, mention, and context signal is captured and scored.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="reveal text-center">
      <div class="relative mx-auto mb-6">
        <div
          class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border-2 border-primary text-primary text-xl font-bold"
        >
          3
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">
        Get client-ready search intelligence
      </h3>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-xs mx-auto">
        See exactly where your brand appears, which competitors AI prefers, and
        which topics you’re absent from. Turn these insights into content plans,
        GEO/AEO experiments, and client-ready reports.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal text-center mt-12">
    <a
      href="/use-cases"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary transition-colors hover:text-primary/80"
    >
      See use cases for brands & agencies
      <svg
        class="h-4 w-4"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
